<title>USA: Wall Street opens higher.</title>
<headline>Wall Street opens higher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow industrials and the Nasdaq compasite opened higher on Monday, with markets anticipating the Federal Reserve policy-maker meeting tomorrow, which should offer direction about U.S. rates.</p>
<p>Dow Industrials rose 14.43 to 7,209.10. The 30-year long bond rose 1/32 to yield 6.90 percent.</p>
